|YKOWhen you are killed, you become a ghost and lose many of the
abilities you had while alive. If you are level 5 and under,
you can go to the church and |YKB<pray> |YKOand you will be resurrected
with no penalty. Above level 5, each death brings about a loss
of all your experience on hand, one level, and one from each
of your stats. Some guilds have the ability to resurrect dead
players. This saves some of the stat loss, but the victim still
loses a level and his experience on hand. 

After dying, you can get someone to avenge your death. If you
are avenged, you can get some of your lost experience back. See
|YKBhelp deathavengement |YKOfor for information. Don't ask for avengement
if you are level 5 or under, just go to Plum and pray.

|WKBSee also: |YKBghost, ghostemotes, deathavengement
